WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:21.123
Hello! Wow! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.124 --> 00:00:25.290
I'm a great white shark.

3
00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:30.295
I'm one of the biggest fish on earth!

4
00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.077
Where do you live?

5
00:00:33.078 --> 00:00:36.895
Great white sharks live in the ocean.

6
00:00:36.896 --> 00:00:41.140
We like to swim in cool water.

7
00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:44.309
Are you dangerous?

8
00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:48.871
We can be very dangerous.

9
00:00:48.872 --> 00:00:52.982
But we don't usually attack people.

10
00:00:52.983 --> 00:00:58.478
Instead people often hunt us!

11
00:00:58.479 --> 00:01:01.059
What do you eat?

12
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.118
We eat lots of fish.

13
00:01:04.119 --> 00:01:22.277
We also eat sea lions, dolphins, and turtles.

14
00:01:22.278 --> 00:01:25.973
So you have to hunt for food?

15
00:01:25.974 --> 00:01:29.870
Yes, we're amazing hunters.

16
00:01:29.871 --> 00:01:36.988
We can smell our prey from far away.

17
00:01:36.989 --> 00:01:41.645
Your teeth look pretty sharp!

18
00:01:41.646 --> 00:01:45.658
Our teeth are very sharp!

19
00:01:45.659 --> 00:01:50.146
We have about three hundred of them.

20
00:01:50.147 --> 00:01:53.137
See . . .? Snap!

21
00:01:53.138 --> 00:01:55.900
Are you fast?

22
00:01:55.901 --> 00:02:00.142
Great white sharks are very fast!

23
00:02:00.143 --> 00:02:03.996
Our tails are long and powerful.

24
00:02:03.997 --> 00:02:14.332
They help us shoot through the water.

25
00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:18.005
Look! There's another shark.

26
00:02:18.006 --> 00:02:20.068
Good-bye!

27
00:02:20.069 --> 00:02:28.911
Good-bye, Great White Shark!
